        <td>Courtesy of Justin Nystrom of the River Bend Gun Club
        in Dawson County Georgia, here are answers to the most
        common questions asked by those interested in attending
        the National Pistol Matches at Camp Perry.</td>
        <td width="200"><a href="http://www.rbgc.org/"
        target="_parent"><img src="rivrbend.gif"
        alt="River Bend Gun Club" border="0" width="188"
